{"id":"religiya","lemma":"религия","pos":"noun","rank":4024,"glosses":["religion"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ed/Ru-%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B3%D0%B8%D1%8F.ogg/Ru-%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B3%D0%B8%D1%8F.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"религии","plural":"религии"},"examples":[{"text":"Давайте не будем говорить о религии.","en":"Let's not talk about religion.","words":[{"g":"to let"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"to speak, to talk"},{"g":"about"},null]},{"text":"Мы никогда не говорили о религии.","en":"We never talked about religion.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"never, nevermore"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"about"},null]},{"text":"Они хотят поговорить о религии.","en":"They want to talk about religion.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to have a conversation"},{"g":"about"},null]},{"text":"Религия есть опиум народа.","en":"Religion is the opium of the people.","words":[null,{"g":"there is / to eat"},{"g":"opium"},{"g":"people","l":"народ"}]},{"text":"Не говорите со мной о религии.","en":"Don't talk to me about religion.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"I","l":"я"},{"g":"about"},null]}]}